Assign exactly one role to each person: "Project Lead", "Backend Architect", "Documentation & Training", "Stakeholder Coordination".

Return a JSON object whose keys are the four role names and whose values are the full name of the person assigned, plus a key "reason" (one sentence). Respond ONLY with a valid JSON object and nothing else.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{
  "Project Lead": {
    "person": "Aditya Rao",
    "reason": "Aditya has excellent leadership skills, making him suitable for the Project Lead role."
  },
  "Backend Architect": {
    "person": "Nikita Joshi",
    "reason": "Nikita's strong technical background and experience make her ideal for the Backend Architect position."
  },
